  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>α</mi></math> and <math><mi>β</mi></math> are the roots of equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>β</mi></math> are in arithmetic progression and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>β</mi></math> are in harmonic progression, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
